</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/00526148-0d38-11ea-9a1e-005056a9aa4d/w:1024/p:16x9/5c941b73e4ded6e2a73d0928baf02c64051e21a9.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/00526148-0d38-11ea-9a1e-005056a9aa4d/w:1024/p:16x9/5c941b73e4ded6e2a73d0928baf02c64051e21a9.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2b50901c-9261-11f1-96be-993bcf225f8b</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 14:56:55 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/00526148-0d38-11ea-9a1e-005056a9aa4d/w:1024/p:16x9/5c941b73e4ded6e2a73d0928baf02c64051e21a9.jpg">AFP</source><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>中国海警船遭自家军舰误撞一年后 北京低调宣布两人死亡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260807-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B5%B7%E8%AD%A6%E8%88%B9%E9%81%AD%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%B6%E5%86%9B%E8%88%B0%E8%AF%AF%E6%92%9E%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8E-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BD%8E%E8%B0%83%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%A4%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1</link><description>
